<Layouts.app flash={@flash}>
  <.h1>Visualized Elixir</.h1>

  <.p>
    Although I write Elixir professionally and am familiar with many of these concepts, I've never had a chance to slow down and really explore them outside of trying to deliver a specific project.
  </.p>

  <.p>
    This repository is an exercise in learning in public. With luck it'll be helpful for others too. Code and documentation handwritten by a real human unless otherwise noted - the best way to learn is by doing.
  </.p>

  <.p>Onward, together ❤️</.p>

  <.h2>Explore visualizations</.h2>

  <ul id="explore" class="max-w-2xl space-y-3">
    <li>
      <.link
        navigate="/supervisors"
        class="block rounded-lg border border-base-300 p-4 hover:border-base-content/30 hover:bg-base-200"
      >
        <div class="font-semibold">Supervisors</div>
        <div class="mt-1 text-base-content/70">
          Interactively build Supervision trees. Configure different strategies and restart policies. Then use Actions to stop, kill, terminate, restart processes and visualize how they all work together.
        </div>
      </.link>
    </li>
  </ul>
</Layouts.app>
